+# OMNI-FORGE (Grok Build export)
+
+This repository is a **Grok Build** export of the OMNI-FORGE UI
+(`app-builder-workspace`). Single commit on `main`: `Export from Grok`.
+
+It is **not** Cursor Origin Genesis (`yuri-afk/genesis`) and **not**
+the landing pad (`yuro1991-afk/main`).
+
+## Scripts
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run dev          # Vite on :8080
+npm test             # node --test scripts/**/*.test.mjs
+npm run typecheck    # tsc --noEmit
+npm run lint
+```
+
+`GET /api/v1/health` is liveness for this app only. A timeout or
+connection error is `unreachable`. Never mark Superbrain or this
+service LIVE on a failed probe. This is not BOSS `:45001` and not
+GOOSE-PC `:8791`.
+
+`.vercel/output` is build residue. Ignore it (see `.gitignore`); do
+not treat committed Nitro output as source.
+
+## License
+
+See the files in this export. Weights and host paths are not in git.
